 "criterio_aceite_execucao": "A run counts as completed if rc=0 AND the run JSON records insumos.sha256_rf_data_bate_manifest_v4=true (proof of provenance). A run with rc=3 (sha256 does not match) is a provenance finding, not a valid run. A run not started because of the budget = abortado_por_orcamento, with no conclusion on the hypothesis; document it as partial coverage.",
 "analise_pre_registrada": {
  "metricas": "RSSI MAE (channel 3) per population (valid = target[:,0] < 299; sentinel; all) and PL MAE (channel 0) on valid nodes, from the physical predictions in the .npz; never from a log",
  "2.2_deriva_com_modelo": "per cell and model: SD of MAE_validos across the 5 split seeds; compare with the SD of the means across the 4 cells (same rule as 2.1); also report the SD of the analytical baselines on the SAME split draws, read from baselines_analiticos.test of the run JSON",
  "3.3_inversao_por_sorteio": "fraction of (cell × split draw) in which MAE_validos(model) < MAE of the baselines (fspl, hata_rural, cost231_sub from baselines_analiticos.test, same split draw), per model; no aggregate magnitude across cells",
  "paridade_sob_sorteio": "GNN−MLP contrast paired by split seed within the cell: median, min, max, no. of split draws with GNN better out of 5, in the 3 populations; tolerance = SD across split draws of the MLP MAE_sent in the cell (rule of A3_analise)",
  "sensibilidade_larguras": "per cell (Bauru Q1, Lins Q1): distribution across 5 seeds of (MAE_pop old − MAE_pop new), paired by training seed with the mlp_v3_a3_* runs; negligible effect if |median| ≤ SD across seeds of the new widths in the same cell and population; otherwise reported with sign",
  "gradscaler_e_canal_1": "same rules as criterio_A3_analise (post-warm-up jumps ≤ 1 %, minimum scale ≥ 1; R-c1..R-c3 only flag)",
  "proveniencia": "all runs with insumos.sha256_rf_data = manifest v4 (tensores_cftudo); in the same cell and split seed, identical test-partition hash GNN×MLP; a run with rc=3 is a finding, not data",
  "nao_determinismo": "no individual run is citable; only distributions; checkpoint selection is part of the variance",
  "votos": "3 independent recalculations per number; aggregation script (v3_A4_agregar.py, to be written BEFORE reading any A4 prediction) re-run independently and read in full",
  "proibido": "fix tolerances a priori in dB; read predictions before the batch closes; compare with numbers from the IEEE Access article"
 },
 "condicao_de_lancamento": "only after 'ALL 80 runs completed' for A3 (single GPU); modelo_v3 code byte-identical to the code approved in the A3 gate; free VRAM ≥ 1 GB; embedding server (pid 1630) left untouched; driver launched with setsid nohup",
 "orcamento": "40 runs ≈ 20×16 min + 20×2 min ≈ 6 h; 10 MLP ≈ 20 min; driver cap 840 min"
